			<details style="background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(16,24,40,0.1);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 18px;">
				<summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#101828;">How does PropertyList make money?</summary>
				<p style="margin:10px 0 0;color:rgba(16,24,40,0.75);line-height:1.65;">Credits, from one prepaid balance - and every charge is optional. Receiving a lead costs nothing: portal enquiries are free for a limited time, and leads from other agents or from your MicroSite are free forever. If you choose to move a qualified buyer into the Buyer pipeline, that is 1 credit, with your first 5 free - and if you never move them, you never pay. The same goes for featuring a listing, property reports, the Rentals and Automation &amp; Nurture modules, the XML feed that puts the whole network&#39;s stock on your own website, and the custom Website Builder, which is free to build and preview and only billed once you publish it live. Nothing switches itself on. Listing and selling stay free, so the network keeps growing.</p>
